  "product": "GTS",
  "name": "Four Bar Downlifter",
  "author": "Riddim Rack",
  "description": "The mirror of the riser: after the drop the energy falls away over four bars, getting darker, lower and narrower under a reverb wash. Hold one note for four bars, C3 works best, mono; the fall locks to the host tempo and restarts on every note. Macros: Fall Speed darkens the tone further as the fall plays out; Noise Level raises the hiss; Depth lets the pitch fall further; Reverb Tail deepens the wash.",
